# Analysis Summary

Enterprise Discovery identified the authoritative enterprise entities.

Enterprise Analysis establishes the authoritative relationships between those entities.

Enterprise capabilities form an interconnected enterprise ecosystem.

Each capability owns one authoritative enterprise responsibility while collaborating through well-defined enterprise relationships.

These relationships remain independent of runtime execution, implementation, persistence, APIs, and technology.

---

# Current Assessment

Enterprise relationship analysis establishes the semantic foundation for subsequent Persistence Architecture.

Logical data models, persistence architecture, enterprise services, and runtime orchestration shall be derived from these validated enterprise relationships rather than implementation-specific assumptions.

Enterprise relationship analysis intentionally precedes persistence architecture to preserve constitutional separation between enterprise semantics and technology implementation.